	"Description": "Spin and drill for the GSTN combat: a stick-rotation spin on the ground and in the air, the opposite-spin cancel, and the drill (dive along gravity, latch, bore, launch). Skeleton only (checkpoint D1): native tags in GSTNSpinDrillCore and empty NP, GAS, Presentation and Tests modules. Enabling it changes nothing until a kit binds its commands.",
